1|# GUIDE 05 — Stage-end commit/push failure crash loop (pre-commit hooks, git faults)
2|
3|Cause 5 in `WIDE_NET_ANALYSIS.md`. On the deployed 0.1.0 build a stage-end
4|`commitAndPush` failure takes the generic catch: bare interrupt + rethrow ->
5|`exit(1)` -> systemd `Restart=always` -> re-claim -> agent re-runs -> same
6|commit failure -> loop, until the death bound parks the task. Documented
7|precedent: task `1cae113f` — "the runner restarted over 10,000 times in a
8|crash loop after the commit failed" (corrupt PNGs vs the pre-commit binary
9|guard). Fix `046a6391` (deterministic git failure -> FAILED completion, never a
10|crash) merged 11-21 09:38 in `7ac148ce` — after every observed interruption —
11|and still needs runner rollout. Ruled out on the one forensically examined
12|case (`7f6220c3` Merge resolver: commit+push succeeded, killer was the 413 —
13|see GUIDE 02).
14|
15|- **Verdict: REPLICABLE-LOCALLY** for the mechanism (temp git repo + failing
16|  pre-commit hook; no agent needed — call `commitAndPush` directly). A full
17|  e2e with a real agent stage is PROD-ACTION (flagged in §4).
18|- **Code seams:** `runner/gitOps.js:114` `commitAndPush(...)` attaches
19|  `err.gitFailure = buildGitFailureDetails(...)` on hook/commit failure;
20|  `shared/gitFailure.js` -> `isDeterministicGitFailure` (true for
21|  `HOOK_REJECTED` / `COMMIT_FAILED` / `MERGE_CONFLICT`,
22|  `shared/gitFailure/isDeterministicGitFailure.js:17-24`);
23|  `runner/daemon.js:2316-2380` — deterministic git failure ->
24|  `client.complete({ outcome: "failed", failureKind: "commit-failed",
25|  gitFailure, committed: false })` and **return** (never rethrow);
26|  `runner/daemon.js:2441-2452` — everything else rethrows (fatal on
27|  `Restart=always`).
28|
29|## 1. Signature (recognise it)
30|
31|- Task history: bare (on 0.1.0) interrupt **after `finished`** (post-harness,
32|  in the commit/push/complete phase), preceded by a multi-minute run; worktree
33|  `kb-<taskId>` on the runner host has **no** stage-output commit (contrast
34|  with GUIDE 02, where the commit IS present).
35|- Runner journal: `Runner failed: <git/hook error>` + `commit failed (...)`
36|  on 0.2.0, plus `restart counter` increments each lap.
37|- Loop ends only via the `runner-death-loop` park at 5 consecutive interrupts.
